his output was undrained** — the w1-03/polish-02 shape. Nothing lost: the tip was archived as `archive/lane-perf-s1440-452eb747` as this fire's first act, before gating. Review `reviews/lane-e1-perf-pass.md`. **GATE: F-1440-2 corrective re-lands the spec with a machine-independent gate.**
