# Lantern replay cannot reach its tactical fallback without WebGL

The plain watch path constructs Game and its WebGL renderer before LanternShow. Returning null for WebGL context creation makes it throw and return to the start menu; the Lantern fallback cannot run. Reproduced with a valid current-era Claim fixture at 1280x800 and 390x844, with working control boots.

The lantern-true-world-reel task permits only an optional world-stage call in Game and excludes main.ts, so its no-WebGL requirement needs a revised firewall. The implementer stopped with evidence and left all runtime code unchanged. Contract-global Terrain state and SVG-specific adjacent assertions also need attention.

Evidence and exact source coordinates: [lane coupling report](</Users/robin/Claude/Projects/Gold Rush/worktrees/lane-c/artifacts/lantern-true-world/REPORT.md>). [[MOCs/Gold Rush MOC]]

